<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <RootNamespace>Lumoin.Veritas.Owl</RootNamespace>
    <Description>OWL 2 RL forward-chaining reasoner for Lumoin.Veritas. Implements the OWL 2 RL profile axiom types (SubClassOf, SubPropertyOf, TransitiveProperty, SymmetricProperty, InverseOf, PropertyChain, EquivalentClass) as inference rules that fire against the dataset to fixpoint. TBox loads in memory; ABox streams through.</Description>
  </PropertyGroup>

